  "description": "2 Bedroom Apartment with Stunning Sea Views – Claremont, Howth – €2,750\n\nBeautiful brand-new 2-bedroom apartment in Claremont, Howth, offering stunning sea views, spacious living areas and access to fantastic residents’ facilities.\n\nThe apartment is bright, spacious and modern, with 2 large double bedrooms, one of which has an en-suite bathroom, and a generous open-plan living/dining area integrated with the kitchen.\n\nProperty Features\n\n* 2 large double bedrooms\n* 1 en-suite bathroom\n* Main bathroom\n* Spacious open-plan living/dining/kitchen area\n* Entrance hallway\n* Separate storage room\n* Utility room\n* Stunning sea views\n* Pet-friendly\n* Underground parking available (€50/month)\n\nResidents’ Facilities\n\nResidents have exclusive access to a great range of facilities within the development, including:\n\n* Fully equipped residents’ gym\n* Residents’ café\n* Concierge service\n* Dedicated workspace / co-working area\n* Residents’ TV room / lounge\n\nThe development also has a creche, Tesco and a café on-site, making everyday life particularly convenient.\n\nLocation – Claremont, Howth\n\nThe location is one of the highlights of this apartment, with excellent transport links and local amenities close by:\n\n* DART station: approximately 5 minutes’ walk\n* Bus stop: right outside the development\n* Howth Pier: approximately 7 minutes away\n* Tesco, café and creche within the development\n* Excellent public transport connections\n* Easy access to the beautiful Howth coastline and local amenities\n\nRent & Parking\n\nRent: €2,750 per month\nUnderground parking: €50 per month (optional)\n\nLandlord Requirements\n\nThe landlord will require specific documentation from prospective tenants as part of the application and approval process, which will be outlined upon contact.\n\nOnce the application has been approved, the successful applicant will also be required to provide a PPS number and Photo ID.\n\nPlease note that the landlord applies an affordability requirement: the rent must not exceed 40% of the tenant’s net monthly funds.\n\nDeposit & Lease Assignment\n\nPlease note that this property is available through a lease assignment, subject to landlord approval.\n\nOne month's rent is required as a deposit.\n\nInterested?\n\nA fantastic opportunity for someone looking for a brand-new, spacious apartment with beautiful sea views, excellent residents’ facilities and a great location in Claremont, Howth.\n\nIf you’re genuinely interested and meet the landlord’s requirements, please get in touch for further information or to arrange a viewing.",
